1
00:00:00,249 --> 00:00:03,740
Have you ever dreamed of creating your own
horror survival game?

2
00:00:04,169 --> 00:00:07,980
If the answer is yes, you're in a great
place because in this course you will

3
00:00:07,981 --> 00:00:13,380
learn everything that you need to know in
order to create your own dream horror game.

4
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:14,820
We'll start very simple.

5
00:00:15,004 --> 00:00:19,880
We will create a simple first person
character movement and we'll also expand

6
00:00:19,881 --> 00:00:22,360
this movement to add crouching and
sprinting.

7
00:00:22,510 --> 00:00:26,380
Then we will see how we can create
interaction system in Unreal Engine and we

8
00:00:26,381 --> 00:00:29,880
will create a lot of different
interactable actors such as doors,

9
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:32,820
drawers, paper pages that we can collect.

10
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:38,240
We will also give our player a realistic
flashlight because we will create a creepy

11
00:00:38,539 --> 00:00:40,760
realistic and dark forest.

12
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:46,220
In that forest we will create a monster AI
that will try to find and kill the player.

13
00:00:46,589 --> 00:00:48,980
We will also cover a lot of sound design.

14
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:52,188
We will see how we can
create realistic footsteps that will

15
00:00:52,189 --> 00:00:54,800
change depending on the
material that we're stepping into.

16
00:00:54,970 --> 00:00:57,505
We're also going to add
a sound to pretty much

17
00:00:57,506 --> 00:01:00,080
every interactable actor
and our monster enemy.

18
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:04,620
After that we will create a complete
gameplay loop where we have to collect

19
00:01:04,694 --> 00:01:09,420
eight different pages, find a key to a
hidden cabin where we will have to burn

20
00:01:09,421 --> 00:01:12,540
these pages and kill the monster before he
kills us.

21
00:01:12,679 --> 00:01:16,800
After that we will also see how we can
create different menus in Unreal Engine

22
00:01:16,801 --> 00:01:21,960
such as main menu or pause menu and after
completing the game I will show you how

23
00:01:21,961 --> 00:01:24,234
you can package this
project so you can share

24
00:01:24,235 --> 00:01:26,400
it with your friends
or upload it to internet.

25
00:01:26,604 --> 00:01:30,040
If that sounds interesting, I will see you
in the first lesson.

